Study Circle

About the Project

Study Circle is a student-focused study platform designed to help Grade 12 students build consistent study habits, stay motivated, and learn together.

Main Goals

- Study Streaks: Encourage students to study consistently and track their daily progress.
- Study Planner: Help students organize their study goals and daily tasks.
- Resource Library: Provide a place for students to share worksheets, past examinations, and practice questions.
- Study Community: Support peer learning through discussions, questions, and group study.

Target Users

High school students, especially Grade 12 students preparing for examinations.

Purpose

The purpose of Study Circle is to make studying more consistent, collaborative, and accessible by combining personal planning with peer motivation and educational resources.

Project Status

This is a student graduation project under development. Features and functionality will be evaluated and improved as development continues.

